  unitName: Zedus
  unitId: 840134
  unitNumber: 8064
  description: Zedus was the first demi-god created by the old gods in an attempt
    to establish a utopian land. Birthed from a ravaging lightning storm, he wielded
    the power of electric carnage and could strike down any foe within moments. With
    his exceptional leadership skills, he guided the rest of the demi-gods toward
    achieving new milestones of civilization. Seeing potential in the talented tinkerer
    Gazia, Zedus assigned him to technological research for the development of Athensphere.
    However, as time went by, Gazia experimented with forbidden technology that disrupted
    the balance of nature. Fearing that it would become uncontrollable, Zedus ordered
    him to shut down his research...
  summonDesc: Together, let's create a utopia.
  fusionDesc: I need more thunderbolts.
